  "description": "There was once a princess who was despised and scorned as the \"Demon Princess.\" Her wish was never anything grand. She simply wanted just one person—just one—to be on her side. She desperately wished for someone who would truly love her. Then, a bizarre, otherworldly ghost appears before her. This \"ghost\" swears his eternal love to the Demon Princess.\n\n**Original Webtoon :**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852115), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14374145)",
